      "text": "## Trip highlights\n\nExperience a trip to the unique Canaima National Park, located at the tri-border area of Venezuela, Brazil, and Guyana. The program includes a climb and ascent of Mount Roraima.\n\nAlong the way, you will encounter indigenous settlements, mountain rivers, intricate rock formations, canyons with unique vegetation and endemic species, numerous lagoons, and waterfalls. You will also see the world’s tallest waterfall – Salto Ángel (Angel Falls)."
